<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Pay &amp; Display</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">One Simple Trick</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0dHrsj0QV3lFvBRh6QqcPM</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.760" end="00:25.870">Darling would you get my gun, I've got a new prescription</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.870" end="00:32.910">That up-market, top of your road, off license that's 24/7</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.910" end="00:35.680">That till's a ticket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.680" end="00:39.310">To get us outta town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.310" end="00:41.740">And your indecision's</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.740" end="00:44.940">The only thing weighing us down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.940" end="00:51.810">But I'm, oh I'm not scared if you're not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.810" end="00:57.070">Oh no, no I'd never be scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.070" end="00:58.570" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.510" end="01:00.260">Passed away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.260" end="01:03.880">I hope that heaven's got a pay n' display</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.880" end="01:06.870">The blessed always get their way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.870" end="01:08.790">On a subscription basis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.790" end="01:11.310">Sell me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.310" end="01:13.100">Just last week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.100" end="01:16.850">I took the pills they sold to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.850" end="01:20.270">I hide the tithing up my sleeve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.270" end="01:21.840">I'm your creation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.840" end="01:23.470">Buy me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.470" end="01:30.890" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.890" end="01:37.080">But darling it's a simple thought, just trust your intuition</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.080" end="01:44.800">You know nothing's really lost, it's all just redistribution</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.800" end="01:46.890">'Cause your name, the hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.890" end="01:50.430">They all dissolve in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.430" end="01:52.990">This life devours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.990" end="01:56.450">The only thing that you left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.450" end="02:02.590">But oh, I think my head is breaking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.590" end="02:08.580">Oh no, no, I can't afford to be scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.580" end="02:10.080" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.670" end="02:11.250">Passed away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.250" end="02:14.960">I hope that heaven's got a pay n' display</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.960" end="02:17.870">The blessed always get their way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.870" end="02:19.830">On a subscription basis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.830" end="02:22.390">Sell me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.390" end="02:24.520">Just last week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.520" end="02:28.020">I took the pills they sold to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.020" end="02:31.310">I hide the tithing up my sleeve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.310" end="02:33.010">I'm your creation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.010" end="02:36.090">Buy me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.090" end="02:37.590" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.110" end="02:40.220">In six star hotel rooms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.220" end="02:42.700">You begin to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.700" end="02:44.450">This little tedium</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.450" end="02:49.780">Oh it's getting hard to justify</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.780" end="02:53.280">If you called me a bastard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.280" end="02:56.440">I would fucking like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.440" end="02:59.760">I hate that I would like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.760" end="03:01.980">I hate that I could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.980" end="03:03.480">Pass away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.310" end="03:06.850">I heard that heaven's got a pay n' display</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.850" end="03:09.920">The blessed always get their way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.920" end="03:11.800">On a subscription basis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.800" end="03:14.190">Sell me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.190" end="03:16.580">Just last week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.580" end="03:19.860">I took the pills they sold to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.860" end="03:23.100">I hide the tithing up my sleeve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.100" end="03:24.850">I'm your creation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.850" end="03:28.940">Buy me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.940" end="03:30.900">Buy me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.900" end="03:35.350" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.350" end="03:37.610">Buy me salvation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.610" end="03:41.610" /></div></body></tt>